g toward a full Steam Deck Verified status. This patch cleans up several backend issues to make playing on a controller and handheld much smoother.Controller Glyphs: The UI now dynamically displays proper Steam Deck and gamepad buttons in all menus and submenus.Menu Navigation: Fixed an issue where the D-Pad would occasionally lock up or require a mouse click to focus the main menu.Video Playback: Rebuilt the intro sequence video player to run","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T21:42:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199305553","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3141280-1833968530901635","game_id":"steam-3141280","kind":"update","title":"Massive Demo Update: New Scares, Hiding Mechanics & Gamepad Optimizations","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the demo and shared their feedback! We've been hard at work under the hood, and we are thrilled to bring you a massive update focused on deepening the atmosphere, smoothing out the gameplay, and adding some terrifying new surprises. Here is everything new in this update:🩸 New Scares & ImmersionDynamic Exhaustion: Pushing yourself too hard will now trigger heavy breathing, camera FOV heartbeats, and vision blur. Manage your stamina carefully!Enhanced Audio: We","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T21:59:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530901635","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3141280-1832700592785072","game_id":"steam-3141280","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Free Prologue Demo Now!","summary":"Hey everyone,We are incredibly excited to announce that a playable demo, INCURABLE: PROLOGUE, is officially available to download and play right now!This short, standalone experience drops you into the final hours of a doomed village in the isolated woods of West Virginia. It serves as a direct prequel, setting the stage for the dark events in the main game.In the Prologue, you will:Face the Butcher: A relentless stalker hunting you through the village. You cannot fight him. You must use the env","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T00:33:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592785072","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3141280-1829528821318113","game_id":"steam-3141280","kind":"announcement","title":"The Incurable Store Page is Live","summary":"Hey everyone,The Steam page for Incurable is officially up. I’m the solo developer behind the project, and getting this hub live is a great milestone to finally hit.If you’re just checking the game out: Incurable is a psychological survival horror game. There's no combat or gunning your way out. You play as a psychiatrist named Mike, and survival comes down to stealth, managing your limited flashlight batteries, and navigating a cursed village without getting caught by the things hunting you.The","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-14T15:23:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821318113","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3141280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:22:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:22:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3141280":"2026-10-26T00:22:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3141280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:22:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-